sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Employee
  participant W as Web
  participant A as Auth API
  participant P as PersonnelProvider
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>W: personnel_number + phone
  W->>A: POST /v1/auth/verify (TLS)
  A->>P: verifyIdentityPair
  alt matched
    P-->>A: matched + provider snapshot
    A->>D: reconcile provider-owned fields/history
    A->>D: load app role/status
    A->>D: create hashed server session
    A-->>W: opaque bearer + profile/gates
  else no_match
    P-->>A: no_match
    A-->>W: AUTH_VERIFICATION_FAILED (non-enumerating)
  else unavailable/config error
    P-->>A: dependency failure
    A-->>W: DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE
  end
